    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n21598" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Iluro</span></b> , ōnis, f., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>a town in</i>
			Hispania Tarraconensis, <i>the modern Maltaeo</i>,
				<i><span class="en">Plin.
				3, 3, 4, § 22</span></i>.—Hence, <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Ilurensis</span></b> , is,
				m., <i>an inhabitant of Iluro</i>,
					<i><span class="en">Inscr. Grut. 406, 9</span></i>.</div>
